NOTE ON DATA

This licence covers the source code, notebooks and documentation in this
repository. It does NOT cover third-party input data, which carries its own
terms:

  * ALKIS cadastral building data — supplied by the responsible state survey
    authority; redistribution is governed by that authority's licence.
  * OpenStreetMap extracts (region.pbf, land-use layers) — © OpenStreetMap
    contributors, available under the Open Database License (ODbL).
  * Zone-level activity targets — provided by Regionalverband Großraum
    Braunschweig; not redistributable without their permission.

None of these datasets are distributed in this repository (see .gitignore).
